        "node_id": "n_2_8c2a04",
        "thought_text": "The issue lies in the logic where the code checks if the current number of students taken is within the allowed range before updating the counts. This can lead to incorrect decisions if the group size exceeds the allowed limit but could still be part of a valid solution. Instead, the code should first update the counts and then check if the new total is within the allowed range. This ensures that all possible combinations are considered before making a decision.",
